  "bodyHash": "8e4e6519833165e2",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Metal Bundles</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 為《我的世界》的收納袋系統帶來更進階的升級路線，提供由日益珍貴材料製成的大型收納袋階層。透過皮革、銅、鐵、金、鑽石和獄髓等多種變體升級你的收納袋，讓你在冒險旅途中攜帶更多物品。📦</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更大的容量只是其中一部分。本模組也改進了收納袋的使用方式，讓物品欄管理更快、更直覺。瀏覽已儲存的內容、精確選擇你想使用的物品，並在無需頻繁開啟專屬介面的情況下快速存入或取出物品。🎯</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">本模組基於《我的世界》現代的收納袋機制打造，在保留原版熟悉體驗的同時，加入了更強大的導航功能、更清晰的視覺呈現以及更多的物品欄互動操作。無論你是在整理建築素材、攜帶戰利品，或是為長途旅行做準備，大型收納袋都將變得更加實用。✨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">六種全新收納袋階層：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 製作皮革、銅、鐵、金、鑽石與獄髓收納袋，隨階層提升而擁有更大的儲存容量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可升級的遞進系統：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 將現有收納袋從當前階層逐步升級至下一階，無需重新製作全新的收納袋。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">查看所有已存物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 直接在收納袋的提示文字中顯示所有內部物品，讓大型收納袋的導覽變得輕鬆許多。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">精確選擇已存物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 使用滑鼠滾輪或鍵盤方向鍵，精確選擇你想要互動的已存物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📝 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">已選物品詳情：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 瀏覽收納袋內容時，即時顯示目前所選物品的詳細資訊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">↔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">快速物品轉移：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 透過直覺的物品欄互動操作，快速存入與取出物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖱️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">跨多個槽位拖曳：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 點擊並拖曳跨越多個物品欄槽位，一次性批量存入或取出物品，大幅提升管理效率。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎚️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">精確物品移動：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 按住 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Control</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Mac 上為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Command</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）可單個移動物品而非整組，並精確控制轉移數量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">智慧相容性指示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 視覺提示會顯示手中物品能否放入，以及內部是否已有相符物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📊 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">改良的填充指示器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 增強版的收納袋容量指示器讓你一眼就能掌握儲存空間的使用狀況。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">高度可自訂：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 自訂儲存容量、互動方式、控制設定、提示文字行為與視覺效果，完美契合你的遊玩風格。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器皆須安裝此模組</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">必須安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">必須安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">必須安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援此功能，可直接於遊戲內透過模組選單進行設定（Fabric 版需安裝由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若欲使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有檔案皆位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 資料夾內，檔名分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，視設定類型而定。並非所有模組都會包含全部類型的設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/overflowing-bars\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mob-lassos\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/moblassos/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/magnum-torch\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
